    "• complete tear → look for an ACL tear"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "lcl_pres_0_0",
   "x": 1065,
   "y": 582,
   "w": 236,
   "h": 150,
   "kind": "lcl_t",
   "title": "No swelling if isolated",
   "lines": [
